// Cold damage cantrip with a movement-slow rider, modeled with the existing
// `Slowed` BuffKind (common/src/comp/buff.rs: "Generic movement slow, for
// Slow spells and other sources that should reduce movement speed without
// any other side effect" -- a direct fit, unlike `Chilled` which also adds
// a poise-damage-received penalty this spell's text doesn't call for).
// Damage set slightly below fire_bolt's cantrip anchor (15) to pay for the
// rider while staying at 0 energy, mirroring D&D's own positioning of Ray of
// Frost as the lowest-damage attack cantrip in exchange for the utility.
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 11,
            buff: Some((
                kind: Slowed,
                dur_secs: 4,
                strength: Value(0.3),
                chance: 1.0,
            )),
            damage_kind: Cold,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 55.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
